<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Layout xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!-- THIS COMMENT SITS INSIDE THE ROOT ELEMENT DELIBERATELY. A comment placed ABOVE <Layout>
         breaks `sf` deploy at source conversion with a misleading "unable to find matching parent
         xml file" error.

         BUILT WITH ALL BUSINESS FIELDS FROM DAY ONE, DELIBERATELY, NOT AS A STUB. This repo has
         shipped three stub layouts this week that carried only Name/OwnerId/CreatedById/
         LastModifiedById and no business field (BOV_Submission__c, Disposition_Offer__c,
         Broker_Listing__c - see the "BUSINESS FIELDS ADDED 2026-08-20 (UAT gap)" comment on each
         of those three files). All 11 custom fields plus Name and OwnerId are placed below so
         this object does not become the fourth.

         EVERY FIELD IS SERVICE-WRITTEN IN THE NORMAL PATH, BUT NONE IS FORCED Readonly FOR THAT
         REASON ALONE. BovSubmissionService.replaceSelectedBroker (D4.3, developer-owned) is the
         only path the UI exposes (bovReplaceBrokerModal), and it inserts every field on this
         object in one call - there is no genuine "New BOV Broker Change" user flow. But unlike
         BOV_Submission__c's Approval_Status__c (owned for the record's entire life by an approval
         process's field updates) or Broker_Listing__c's counters, nothing here is re-written after
         insert, and an admin correcting a bad backfill row needs somewhere to type the fix. So the
         DECISION fields - the parent links, the two brokers, Reason, Notes, Entry DateTime and
         Logged By - stay Edit, exactly the same reasoning Broker_Listing__c's layout comment used
         for Days_On_Market__c and Offers_Received__c ("only ever read... locking them would leave
         them permanently at their default" - the inverse risk here is locking a field with no
         other correction path).

         THE TWO FIELDS THAT ARE Readonly ARE READONLY BECAUSE THEY ARE DERIVED FROM A SIBLING
         FIELD ON THIS SAME ROW, NOT BECAUSE THEY ARE OWNED BY LONG-RUNNING AUTOMATION:
         Outgoing_Broker_Firm__c and Incoming_Broker_Firm__c are snapshots stamped from
         Outgoing_Broker__c / Incoming_Broker__c at write time (see each field's own XML comment -
         the snapshot exists specifically to survive scripts/seed-broker-contacts.apex nulling the
         lookup). Hand-editing the Text snapshot independently of the lookup it was stamped from
         would desync the two and defeat the reason the snapshot exists. This is the same rule
         BOV_Submission__c's layout comment states as "MACHINE WRITTEN FIELDS ARE Readonly," applied
         to a same-row derivation instead of an approval-process field update.

         Name stays Readonly. It is an AutoNumber, displayFormat BBC-{0000}.

         THIS OBJECT HAS NO APPROVAL PROCESS, matching Broker_Listing__c's layout, so there is
         correctly no relatedLists block and no RelatedProcessHistoryList here. Nothing was
         removed - this is the object's first layout. -->
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Information</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                <field>Name</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Disposition__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>OwnerId</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Outgoing_BOV_Submission__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Incoming_BOV_Submission__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Broker Change Details</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Outgoing_Broker__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                <field>Outgoing_Broker_Firm__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Reason__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Incoming_Broker__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                <field>Incoming_Broker_Firm__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Notes__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Log Entry</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Entry_DateTime__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                <field>Logged_By__c</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>System Information</label>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                <field>CreatedById</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
            <layoutItems>
                <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                <field>LastModifiedById</field>
            </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>false</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>false</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <layoutColumns/>
        <layoutColumns/>
        <layoutColumns/>
        <style>CustomLinks</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <showEmailCheckbox>false</showEmailCheckbox>
    <showHighlightsPanel>false</showHighlightsPanel>
    <showInteractionLogPanel>false</showInteractionLogPanel>
    <showRunAssignmentRulesCheckbox>false</showRunAssignmentRulesCheckbox>
    <showSubmitAndAttachButton>false</showSubmitAndAttachButton>
</Layout>
